Upstream attribution
====================

This repository contains a customized derivative of the open-source
`ml-paper-writing` skill from Orchestra Research's AI Research Skills library:

https://github.com/Orchestra-Research/AI-Research-SKILLs

The customized version preserves the upstream MIT License and further develops
the skill through a slimmer progressive-disclosure structure, stricter
evidence and delivery checks, and customized notation and equation-formatting
rules.

See LICENSE for the applicable license and original copyright notice.


